<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 25.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 25.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   94/96    100/102    UNQ    160/164</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  98/100   104/106  173/175  183/185</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker quotes were stable on Wednesday despite fewer enquiries than in the previous day, traders said. The recent firm cargo market supported bunker levels but shipowners said they would wait for further development in the cargo market to make their next move. No cargo deals were heard done on late Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
